  "description": "The Substance is the bike that will go anywhere you point it; on whatever surface you choose.\n\nWith a UD carbon frame, tapered headtube, and full carbon forks, the Substance carbon is born tough and light. This bike can go as hard and fast as you want it to or be a lightweight friend for long distance relaxed epic. With the addition of mounts for luggage, mud guards and multiple bottles it’s also capable of the biggest bike packing or touring adventures.\n\nFitted with SRAM's brand new Rival eTap AXS HRD with wireless electronic shifting. This 12 speed groupset offers modern gearing ratio's, advanced chain management and easy personalisation via the app. Top technology in an efficent package, with amazing value.\n\nThe Substance CRS-2 is fitted with Prime Kanza Aluminium wheels, and fitted with big volume WTB Byway TCS 47mm tyres. 650b is perfect for adventure cycling with the large outer diameter keeping your wheels rolling over bumps, whilst the added tyre volume allows you to adjust pressures depending on the terrain for grip, comfort, and luggage weight. The finishing kit is made up of quality parts from FSA and Prime.\n\nDedicated Carbon adventure/gravel frameset\n\nSRAM RIVAL eTap AXS HRD groupset\n\nPrime Kanza 650b Aluminium Disc wheelset\n\nWTB Venture TCS Road Plus 650b x 47 tyres\n\nFull mudguard mounts\n\nRear rack and extra water bottle mounts\n\nAvailable with our exclusive retail partners Mid June!",
